AREA_NAME_MANSION,The Mansion,,La Mansión
AREA_NAME_MANSION_BANNER,MANSION,,MANSIÓN
AREA_UNLOCK_MANSION,You can now adventure to The Mansion!,,¡Ya puedes explorar la mansión!
,,,
//tracy_adventure_shop_script,,,
NPC_TRACY_SHOP_WELCOME_MANSION_1,"I snuck into this mansion, but now I can't find an exit...",,"Me colé en esta mansión, pero no veo ninguna salida..."
NPC_TRACY_SHOP_WELCOME_MANSION_2,Will you hurry?! I'm trying to keep a low profile!!,,¡¿Te puedes dar prisa?! ¡¡Trato de mantener el perfil bajo!!
NPC_JACK_JACK_MANSION_INTRO_1,"[m:questioning]Seen that big mansion?
It's a very big house, [m:mocking]bigger than yours!",,"[m:questioning]¿Viste esa gran mansión?
Es una casa muy grande [m:mocking]¡más grande que la tuya!"
NPC_JACK_JACK_MANSION_INTRO_2,"[m:pondering]I hear lots of people live there, must be a big big family.",,"[m:pondering]Creo que mucha gente vive allí, debe ser una familia muy muy grande."
NPC_JACK_JACK_MANSION_INTRO_3,"[m:whispering][s:.7]That house is really old too, older than Nona.[/s]",,"[m:whispering][s:.7]Esa casa también es bastante antigua, más antigua que la abuelita.[/s]"
NPC_JACK_JACK_MANSION_INTRO_4,"[m:veryhappy]Has to be lots of Nonas in there, too.
All sleeping for ages!",,"[m:veryhappy]Tienen que haber muchas abuelitas allí también.
¡Todas durmiendo por siglos!"
NPC_JACK_JACK_MANSION_INTRO_5,[m:shocked]But last night I heard weird music coming from there!,,[m:shocked]¡Pero anoche escuché música venir de allí!
NPC_JACK_JACK_MANSION_INTRO_6,"[m:default]Dunno what that's about!
Maybe they woke up?",,"[m:default]¡Ni idea de que será!
¿A lo mejor se despertaron?"
NPC_JACK_JACK_MANSION_INTRO_7,[m:happy]Must have been a long dream they had!,,[m:happy]¡Tienen que haberse soñado la vida!
,,,
//enemies,,,
ENEMY_LONGLEG_NAME,Long Leg,,Pierna larga
ENEMY_LONGLEG_DESC,Melee attacks with Knockback 10. Can step in range when next to another leg. Can step next to allies. Loses balance if separated. Undead.,,Ataca con 10 de retroceso. Puede saltar dentro de su alcance cuando está junto a otra pierna. Puede saltar cerca de sus aliados. Pierde el equilibrio si se separa. Muerto viviente.
ENEMY_VAMPIREGUY_NAME,Vampire Guy,,
ENEMY_VAMPIREGUY_DESC,"Bite attacks bleeding units with Lifesteal 2, removing one stack of Bleed. Has a dagger attack that inflicts Bleed.
Undead.",,
ENEMY_VAMPIREGAL_NAME,Vampire Gal,,
ENEMY_VAMPIREGAL_DESC,"Bite attacks bleeding units with Lifesteal 2, removing one stack of Bleed. Has a dagger attack that inflicts Bleed.
Undead.",,
ENEMY_VAMPIREBABY_NAME,Vampire Baby,,
ENEMY_VAMPIREBABY_DESC,"Has a weak bite attack that hits with Lifesteal for every stack of Bleed the target has and removes Bleed.
Transforms into baby bat.
Undead.",,
ENEMY_BABYBAT_NAME,Baby Bat,,
ENEMY_BABYBAT_DESC,"Its melee flurry inflicts Bleed but does no damage. Transforms into vampire baby. 50% Dodge Chance.
Undead.",,
,,,
//bosses,,,
ENEMY_VICTIM_NAME,Victim,,
ENEMY_VICTIM_DESC,Don't get caught!,,
ENEMY_PAWPRINTS_NAME,Paw Prints,,
ENEMY_PAWPRINTS_DESC,Tries to get information out of suspects. Will call her brigade and inflict permanent Marked on all enemy cats if she finds the killer.,,
ENEMY_SIDEKICK_NAME,Sidekick,,
ENEMY_SIDEKICK_DESC,Will try to get Paw Prints' attention after finding a clue.,,
ENEMY_BRIGADEKITTY_NAME,Brigade Kitty,,
ENEMY_BRIGADEKITTY_DESC,Wields a blunderbuss!,,
ENEMY_LILDRAC_NAME,Lil' Drac,,
ENEMY_LILDRAC_DESC,"Has a wide bite attack that removes one stack of Bleed from enemies, then heals all allies and itself. Counterattacks when hit. Undead.",,
ENEMY_SISRUE_NAME,Sister Rue,,
ENEMY_SISRUE_DESC,Has a weak melee attack that inflicts Bleed. Shoots a ghostly barrage in a large cone. Counterattacks when hit. Undead.,,
ENEMY_GRANNY_NAME,Granny Grievance,,
ENEMY_GRANNY_DESC,Blind. Has a magic attack that hits all units in a line. Will always try to attack bleeding units. Counterattacks when hit. Undead.,,
ENEMY_MRFANGS_NAME,Mr. Fangs,,
ENEMY_MRFANGS_DESC,Has a melee spin attack that inflicts Bleed. Runs away when damaged by an ally.,,
ENEMY_THECOUNT_NAME,The Count,,
ENEMY_THECOUNT_DESC,Doesn't take damage from Bleed. Drains Bleed from allies. Gives all of his Bleed to an enemy in range. Undead.,,
